{"ref":"BDB, יוֹבָב","hw":"יוֹבָב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹבָב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>Sab. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יהיבב</span> Glaser<sup>Skizze ii. 303 ff.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  ‘son’ of Yoḳtân <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:29\" href=\"/Genesis.10.29\">Gn 10:29</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.23\">1 Ch 1:23</a>, 𝔊 Ιωβαβ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a king in Edom <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:33\" href=\"/Genesis.36.33\">Gn 36:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:34\" href=\"/Genesis.36.34\">34</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.44\">1 Ch 1:44</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:45\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.45\">45</a>, 𝔊 Ιω(α)βαβ.<br><strong>3.</strong>  king of Madon (Northern Canaan) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:1\" href=\"/Joshua.11.1\">Jos 11:1</a>, 𝔊 Ιω(β)αβ.<br><strong>4.</strong>  Benjamites: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.9\">1 Ch 8:9</a>, 𝔊 Ιωβαβ. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.18\">1 Ch 8:18</a>, 𝔊 Ιω(β)αβ.","next":"BDB, יְבוּס²","prev":"BDB, יָבַב"}